WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.745
[Gentle music]
SharpLsp is built in the open. One repository holds the Rust host, the C# and F# sidecars, the editor integrations, and this website.

00:15.017 --> 00:22.185
The specs are the source of truth. Every section has an ID, and the code and tests that implement it cite that ID.

00:29.417 --> 00:35.708
Everything builds and tests from the command line. Here, the Rust host's unit tests compile and run.
